1
00:00:03,801 --> 00:00:08,501
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:08,692 --> 00:00:10,272
(Penny:)Okay, I'm gonna go pick up
my family.

3
00:00:10,277 --> 00:00:12,697
(Penny:)Like an hour and half,
two hours, depending on traffic.

4
00:00:12,696 --> 00:00:13,866
(Leonard:)Yeah, drive safe.
Oh, hey,

5
00:00:13,864 --> 00:00:15,134
and do yourself a favor,
all right?

6
00:00:15,132 --> 00:00:18,262
(Penny:)When Beverly gets here,
do not bring up last night.

7
00:00:18,268 --> 00:00:19,368
(Penny:)All right?
As far as you're concerned,

8
00:00:19,369 --> 00:00:21,569
(Penny:)you don't know anything,

9
00:00:21,571 --> 00:00:22,591
(Penny:)you didn't see anything.

10
00:00:22,589 --> 00:00:27,039
(Penny:)I want you just to play dumb.

11
00:00:27,044 --> 00:00:30,094
(Sheldon:)It was nice of her to show us
playing dumb with an example.

12
00:00:30,097 --> 00:00:31,517
(Leonard:)What?

13
00:00:31,515 --> 00:00:33,215
(Penny:)Oh.

14
00:00:33,216 --> 00:00:35,386
(Penny:)Hi. Okay, hey there, I got--
I'm sorry, I got to go now.

15
00:00:35,385 --> 00:00:38,305
(Beverley:)Penny, wait.
Why?

16
00:00:38,305 --> 00:00:41,185
(Beverley:)I wanted to thank you for
going through all the trouble

17
00:00:41,191 --> 00:00:44,441
(Beverley:)of planning a second wedding
ceremony for me,

18
00:00:44,444 --> 00:00:46,614
(Beverley:)but unfortunately
I cannot attend.

19
00:00:46,613 --> 00:00:48,733
(Leonard:)Well, why?
What's wrong?

20
00:00:48,732 --> 00:00:50,362
Wha-- are we still doing
the dumb thing?

21
00:00:50,367 --> 00:00:52,447
(Sheldon:)Okay, why, what's wrong?

22
00:00:52,452 --> 00:00:54,622
(Beverley:)I just cannot stay here
while your father

23
00:00:54,621 --> 00:00:56,821
(Beverley:)goes out of his way
to humiliate me.

24
00:00:56,823 --> 00:00:59,963
(Sheldon:)Oh, golly, however
did he humiliate you?

25
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:01,580
(Beverley:)Stop it, Sheldon.

